  "_comment": "2.1400 (#7115): the rights profiles of the one-command setup (static/agent/setup.sh --profile, setup.ps1 -Profile) for Claude Code, written into the project folder's .claude/settings.local.json (allow / deny added, defaultMode set; entries already there stay). {job} = the job tool's command prefix (two spellings), {inst} = the instance folder as a rule path. block_extra goes into the env file as KALMIDO_BLOCK_EXTRA when it has none yet (docs/AGENT-SECURITY.md, project_block). See docs/AGENT-SETUP.md section 7.",
